    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00224_p2_b68",
      "text": "i=1, where x is a prompt\nand y+, y\u2212are responses labeled preferred and dispreferred.\nIn contrast to PPO-based pipelines, there are no online roll-\nouts, no value head, and no reward model trained to conver-\ngence. Crucially, the shaped reward in TUR-DPO does not\ndefine a separate optimization objective, but only modifies\nthe preference margin within the DPO loss, preserving the\nclosed-form, rollout-free optimization structure.\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.44,
        557.83,
        543.19,
        651.71
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        1229,
        2231,
        2172,
