      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 430,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00224_p2_b69",
      "text": "TUR-DPO introduces a lightweight reasoning topology per\ncandidate and derives semantic, structural, and uncertainty\nsignals from this topology. These signals shape the prefer-\nence margin and modulate the per-pair learning rate through\ninstance weighting. The design aims to be practical in\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.13,
        659.71,
        543.09,
        717.49
      ],
